lot=\"label\">Je e-mailadres</span>\n                        <e2-tooltip \n        v-slot=\"tooltip\" \n        static \n        target-toggler \n        aria-label=\"form.component.tooltip.aria.label.default\"aria-label-open=\"form.component.tooltip.aria.label.open\"aria-label-close=\"form.component.tooltip.aria.label.close\"\n    >\n        <i class=\"icon icon-info tooltip-icon\" v-slot=\"target\"></i>\n        <template>\n            <div class=\"subscription-box__tooltip\" v-slot=\"content\">\n                <p><strong>Wij gaan vertrouwelijk om met jouw gegevens</strong></p>\n<p>Door jouw e-mailadres in te vullen bevestig je dat je op de hoogte bent van ons Privacybeleid. Je kunt je altijd afmelden voor onze nieuwsbrieven via de afmeldlink in de nieuwsbrieven of door contact op te nemen met onze klantenservice. Als je jonger bent dan 16 jaar bevestig je dat je ouder of voogd ermee instemt dat je onze nieuwsbrieven ontvangt.</p></div>\n        </template>\n    </e2-tooltip>\n<e2-input-error v-slot=\"error\"></e2-input-error>\n                    </e2-input-field>\n                <e2-wizard-submit default-size\n                    class-modifier=\"button--full-width button--inside-input\"\n                    class=\"subscription-box__form-submit\"\n                    aria-label=\"search\">\n                </e2-wizard-submit>\n            </div>\n        </e2-form-step>\n    </e2-newsletter-subscription-form>\n</div>\n</div></div><div>\n    <a class=\"bottom-banner__wrapper\" href=\"/trekpleister/b/TREKPL\"><e2-impression-tracker\n            track-clicks\n            click-handler=\"handleFooterLink\"\n            data-event=\"footer_logo\"\n            >\n        <div\n            class=\"bottom-banner \"\n            \n        >\n            <div class=\"bottom-banner__logo\">\n                <img class=\"lazyload bottom-banner__embed\"\n                    alt=\"TP HIP Footer Logo\"\n                    data-src=\"/medias/sys_master/images/h43/h82/30828722323486/TP-hip-footer-logo/TP-hip-footer-logo.svg\">\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"bottom-banner__heading\">waar kunnen we je blij mee maken?</h3>\n        </div>\n    </e2-impression-tracker></a>\n        </div><section class=\"footer-horizontal\">\n        <ul class=\"footer-horizontal__items\">\n            <li class=\"footer-horizontal__item\">\n                        <e2-impression-tracker\n                                track-clicks\n                                click-handler=\"handleFooterLink\"\n                                data-event=\"footer_bottom_link\"\n                                data-text=\"Privacy\"\n                        >\n                            <span class=\"yCmsComponent footer-horizontal__link\">\n<a href=\"/privacybeleid\" title=\"Privacy\">Privacy</a>\n            </span></e2-impression-tracker>\n                    </li>\n                <li class=\"footer-horizontal__item\">\n                        <e2-impression-tracker\n                                track-clicks\n                                click-handler=\"handleFooterLink\"\n                                data-event=\"footer_bottom_link\"\n                                data-text=\"Disclaimer\"\n                        >\n                            <span class=\"yCmsComponent footer-horizontal__link\">\n<a href=\"/disclaimer\" title=\"Disclaimer\">Disclaimer</a>\n            </span></e2-impression-tracker>\n                    </li>\n                <li class=\"footer-horizontal__item\">\n                        <e2-impression-tracker\n                                track-clicks\n                                click-handler=\"handleFooterLink\"\n                                data-event=\"footer_bottom_link\"\n                                data-text=\"Algemene Verkoopvoorwaarden\"\n                        >\n                            <span class=\"yCmsComponent footer-horizontal__link\">\n<a href=\"/algemenevoorwaarden\" title=\"Algemene